---
description: >-
  `requirement.curve` (D733, #1378) draws every relation: straight segments here (`linear`),
  where the default draws rounded right angles. `flowchart.curve` no longer reaches a
  requirement diagram, so the `basis` it sets here changes nothing.
config:
  requirement:
    curve: linear
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
---
requirementDiagram
  requirement a {
    id: 1
    text: first
    risk: low
    verifymethod: test
  }
  requirement b {
    id: 2
    text: second
    risk: low
    verifymethod: test
  }
  element e {
    type: simulation
  }
  e - satisfies -> a
  e - satisfies -> b
